ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush\">\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://www.maine.gov/governor/mills/official_documents/executive-orders/2026-01-order-establishing-maine-school-transportation-safety\">Executive Order Establishing the Commission</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://view.officeapps.live.com/op/view.aspx?src=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.maine.gov%2Fsos%2Fsites%2Fmaine.gov.sos%2Ffiles%2Fcontent%2Fassets%2F071c081.docx&amp;wdOrigin=BROWSELINK\">DOE Rule Chapter 81: School Transportation Safety</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://view.officeapps.live.com/op/view.aspx?src=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.maine.gov%2Fsos%2Fsites%2Fmaine.gov.sos%2Ffiles%2Fcontent%2Fassets%2F071c086.docx&amp;wdOrigin=BROWSELINK\">DOE Rule Chapter 86: Maine Uniform School Bus Specifications</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://legislature.maine.gov/legis/statutes/29-A/title29-Ach19sec0.html\">Title 29-A, Chapter 19: Operation — Subchapter 4: School Buses</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://legislature.maine.gov/legis/statutes/20-A/title20-Ach215sec0.html\">Title 20-A, Chapter 215: Transportation</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-sm-6 py-2\">\r\n<div class=\"card h-100\">\r\n<div class=\"card-header text-white bg-primary\"><strong>Public Comments</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush\">\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Transportation%20Safety%20Commission%20-%20Public%20Comment%20Kearns%20-%202.27.2026.pdf\">Kearns</a> (2/27)</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Transportation%20Safety%20Commission%20-%20Public%20Comment%20Maine%20Association%20for%20Pupil%20Transportation%20-%202.27.2026.pdf\">Maine Association for Pupil Transportation</a> (2/27)</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Transportation%20Safety%20Commission%20-%20Public%20Comment%20Stewart%20-%202.27.2026.pdf\">Stewart</a> (2/27)</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Transportation%20Safety%20Commission%20-%20Public%20Comment%20KS%20-%203.19.2026.pdf\">KS</a> (3/19)</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Transportation%20Safety%20Commission%20-%20Public%20Comment%20Anonymous%20-%203.19.2026.pdf\">Anonymous</a> (3/19)</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Transportation%20Safety%20Commission%20-%20Public%20Comment%20Desjardins%20-%203.19.2026.pdf\">Desjardins</a> (3/19)</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Transportation%20Safety%20Commission%20-%20Public%20Comment%20Meehan%20-%203.27.2026.pdf\">Meehan</a> (3/27)</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Transportation%20Safety%20-%20Public%20Comment%20Smith%20-%204.6.2026.pdf\">Smith</a> (4/6)</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Transportation%20Safety%20-%20Public%20Comment%20Nicholson%20-%204.2026.pdf\">Nicholson</a> (4/2026)</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Transportation%20Safety%20-%20Public%20Comment%20Corey%20-%204.2026.pdf\">Corey</a> (4/2026)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\n<p class=\"doe-top\"><a href=\"#top\">Back to top</a></p>","notes":["1 section header — too few for a contents list."],"decisions":[{"id":"balance","on":true,"label":"Give the cards the width their content needs","why":"1 row holds two cards of very different weight in equal halves, and cards in a row are the same height — so the short one is stretched and the difference shows as empty space. 2.3× — 749 characters beside 330. Only the column widths change.","value":"1 row"},{"id":"echo","on":true,"label":"Remove the first section header","removes":"Maine School Transportation Safety Commission","why":"\"Maine School Transportation Safety Commission\" repeats the page title, so the reader is told the same thing twice before any content."},{"id":"deck","on":true,"label":"Use this paragraph as the page description","why":"It is the page’s own opening paragraph, moved into the banner rather than rewritten.","value":"Following the tragic deaths of two Maine students in transportation-related incidents, Governor Janet Mills signed an Executive Order in January 2026, establishing the Maine School Transportation Safety Commission. This Commission will review current statutes and practices related to school transportation protocols, safety standards, and trainings to identify necessary changes or improvements to school transportation in Maine. This work is ultimately intended to ensure the safety and well-being of all students, staff, and school bus drivers across the state."},{"id":"banner-graphic","on":true,"label":"Retire the old banner graphic","why":"It repeats the page title in picture form, which the new banner already does in type.","removes":"Maine School Transportation Safety Commission Banner.png"},{"id":"eyebrow","on":true,"label":"Eyebrow: \"Transportation\"","why":"Taken from the parent page, /schools/transportation."}],"mechanical":["white-on-white text: 5","empty paragraphs removed: 1","loose text wrapped in a paragraph: 26","paragraph inside a table cell unwrapped: 23","table cells released from fixed pixel widths: 3","row colours handed back to the striping rule: 15","paragraph unwrapped inside a card header: 3","action links marked: 30","action marks dropped fro